yte-identical and an edited group is never written from stale bytes. Lists with richer items, nested quotes, and div tags that are not real HTML blocks (such as indented code) stay Raw.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"nextcloud/spreed","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:40:19Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"1de6b4f28141c171c4a35dc781cc25baefba2160","github_link":"https://github.com/nextcloud/spreed/commit/1de6b4f28141c171c4a35dc781cc25baefba2160","commit_subject":"fix(chat): prevent scheduling of file uploads","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"jdeast/EXOZIPPy","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:39:52Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"447cbce05d8cc4c0c753516b01a9512b600689e0","github_link":"https://github.com/jdeast/EXOZIPPy/commit/447cbce05d8cc4c0c753516b01a9512b600689e0","commit_subject":"ob09020: drop the removed `mmexofast: false` key; record the rho-seed ruling","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"SubtitleEdit/subtitleedit","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:39:49Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"c075d371afefe14812a08d76622916b5df11a90c","github_link":"https://github.com/SubtitleEdit/subtitleedit/commit/c075d371afefe14812a08d76622916b5df11a90c","commit_subject":"Fix \"keep gap if close\" nudges settling on min gap + 1 frame","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"Azure/azure-api-management-policy-toolkit","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:39:46Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"d0db42cbd56b5a1a52f3e8b963cf0e20c023242c","github_link":"https://github.com/Azure/azure-api-management-policy-toolkit/commit/d0db42cbd56b5a1a52f3e8b963cf0e20c023242c","commit_subject":"Target .NET 10 tools and support .NET 9/10 libraries (#265)","ai_tool":"Copilot"},{"repo_name":"CircleCI-Public/circleci-yaml-language-server","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:39:46Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"e9a3beb460ed2cc270fd5a3ea3636986bea34000","github_link":"https://github.com/CircleCI-Public/circleci-yaml-language-server/commit/e9a3beb460ed2cc270fd5a3ea3636986bea34000","commit_subject":"feat: go from an